  "scene": {
    "name": "Conveyor Lab 5: Diverter Uses Only Open Destinations",
    "id": "conv_lab_diverter_open_paths",
    "description": "A belt delivers 0.5 products/s to a slow machine A (8 s) and a fast machine B (2 s), through probabilistic 50/50, round-robin and shortest-queue routing. A product is never pushed into a busy machine: A can only take 1/8 per second, so B absorbs the rest and nothing is lost.",
